Q0575 · Easy · ≈23 s · Introductory Undergraduate
575. Let X = {1, …, 9} with open sets ∅ and {1, …, i} for i = 1, …, 9. What is the closure of A = {3, 4,
9}?
A.  {1, 2, 3}
B.  {3, 4, 9}
C.  {3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9}
D.  {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9}
