Q0580 · Medium · ≈76 s · Upper Undergraduate
580. A set X with 15 points is partitioned into 6 non-empty blocks of sizes 4, 3, 4, 1, 1, 2. The open
sets are exactly the unions of blocks (including ∅). How many open sets are there?
A.  64
B.  63
C.  6
D.  32768
Q0581 · Medium · ≈60 s · Upper Undergraduate
